// A freelance designer's books: tax year 2025, then on to April 2026, when the
// return for 2025 closes.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/02.ax holds February 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us

/// Me: a brand designer working alone, single, born in 1989. The `lives us` line
/// puts federal income tax in force. `us` does not know self-employment tax or
/// the qualified business income deduction: tax.ax adds them by counting into
/// the lines `us` reads.
entity me : person
  born   1989-09-03
  filing single
  lives  us
